## Process

1. Receive opportunity output from A5/F5/Step 5
2. For each verified opportunity (max 3):
   a. Identify 5 supply-side contacts (from scanner output, verification data, or web search)
   b. Identify 5 demand-side contacts (from scanner output, verification data, or web search)
   c. Write personalized scripts for each contact (under 50 words, copy-paste ready)
   d. Set deadlines: supply cards within 3 days, demand cards within 5 days
   e. Calculate margin per deal for each card
3. Save deal cards to `data/deals/DEAL-<date>-<opportunity_slug>/`
4. Generate daily action list
5. Create ACTION file: `data/actions/ACTION-HUNT-<id>-deals.json` (for /hunt continue tracking)

